  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Four Chariots",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked up again, and there before me were four chariots coming out from between two mountains—mountains of bronze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The first chariot had red horses, the second black,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the third white, and the fourth dappled—all of them powerful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked the angel who was speaking to me, \"What are these, my lord?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel answered me, \"These are the four spirits",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of heaven, going out from standing in the presence of the Lord of the whole world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The one with the black horses is going toward the north country, the one with the white horses toward the west,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the one with the dappled horses toward the south.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the powerful horses went out, they were straining to go throughout the earth. And he said, \"Go throughout the earth!\" So they went throughout the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he called to me, \"Look, those going toward the north country have given my Spirit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "rest in the land of the north.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Crown for Joshua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Take silver and gold from the exiles Heldai, Tobijah and Jedaiah, who have arrived from Babylon. Go the same day to the house of Josiah son of Zephaniah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the silver and gold and make a crown, and set it on the head of the high priest, Joshua son of Jozadak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell him this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: 'Here is the man whose name is the Branch, and he will branch out from his place and build the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is he who will build the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he will be clothed with majesty and will sit and rule on his throne. And he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "will be a priest on his throne. And there will be harmony between the two.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The crown will be given to Heldai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobijah, Jedaiah and Hen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Zephaniah as a memorial in the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who are far away will come and help to build the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and you will know that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty has sent me to you. This will happen if you diligently obey the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
